---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Flynt CRM & Lead Tracking"
  description="Every lead Flynt delivers lands in your pipeline automatically — scored, researched, and organized by stage. Search your full history in seconds."
>

<!-- ─────────────────────────────────────────────
  SECTION 1 — HERO
───────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="fp-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="fp-hero__layout">
      <div class="tag">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M3 9h18"/><path d="M9 21V9"/></svg>
        Flynt CRM
      </div>
      <h1 class="fp-hero__h1">Every lead you've ever found. <span class="hl">Exactly where you left them.</span></h1>
      <p class="fp-hero__sub">Every lead Flynt delivers lands in your pipeline automatically scored, researched, and organized by stage. Search your full history in seconds. Track every relationship from first contact to signed client. Nothing falls through the cracks.</p>
      <div class="fp-hero__ctas">
        <a href="https://app.tryflynt.ai/" class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" style="background: var(--black); border-color: var(--black);">Start Free Trial →</a>
        <button class="btn btn--outline btn--lg" data-demo-trigger>See It In Action →</button>
      </div>
      <div class="fp-trust">
        <span>✓ Leads auto-organized from Signal</span>
        <span>·</span>
        <span>✓ Instant search</span>
        <span>·</span>
        <span>✓ Stage tracking</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ─────────────────────────────────────────────
  SECTION 2 — BEFORE / AFTER (Spreadsheet vs Pipeline)
───────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="section new-shift">
  <div class="container">

    <div class="tag new-shift__tag">
      <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17"/><polyline points="16 7 22 7 22 13"/></svg>
      Before &amp; After
    </div>
    <div class="new-shift__header">
      <h2 class="new-shift__headline">A spreadsheet isn't a pipeline. It's a list that stops working <span class="hl">when you do.</span></h2>
      <p class="new-shift__lead">This is how most recruiters track BD leads. And this is what changes with Flynt Pipeline.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="new-shift__compare">

      <div class="new-shift__card new-shift__card--old">
        <div class="ns-badge ns-badge--old">
          <span class="ns-badge-icon ns-badge-icon--x">
            <svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M18 6L6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg>
          </span>
          The Spreadsheet Way
        </div>
        <h3 class="ns-card-title">Your pipeline resets every time life gets busy.</h3>
        <hr class="ns-divider" />
        <ul class="ns-list ns-list--old">
          <li>
            <span class="ns-item-icon ns-item-icon--x"><svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M18 6L6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg></span>
            Leads spread across a spreadsheet, your notes app, email threads, and memory.
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="ns-item-icon ns-item-icon--x"><svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M18 6L6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg></span>
            Can't find a lead unless you remember exactly what you named the row.
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="ns-item-icon ns-item-icon--x"><svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M18 6L6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg></span>
            Copy name. Paste email. Update status column. Repeat for every single lead.
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="ns-item-icon ns-item-icon--x"><svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M18 6L6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg></span>
            The only context you have: "contacted" and a date three weeks ago.
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="ns-item-icon ns-item-icon--x"><svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M18 6L6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg></span>
            Land a placement. Stop updating the sheet. Come back, it's useless.
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="ns-item-icon ns-item-icon--x"><svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M18 6L6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg></span>
            The "not now" leads disappear. You never go back to them.
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="ns-item-icon ns-item-icon--x"><svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M18 6L6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg></span>
            Your pipeline resets every time life gets busy.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="new-shift__shift-col" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="new-shift__shift-btn">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        </div>
        <span class="new-shift__shift-label">The Shift</span>
      </div>

      <div class="new-shift__card new-shift__card--new">
        <div class="ns-badge ns-badge--new">
          <span class="ns-badge-icon ns-badge-icon--check">
            <svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
          </span>
          Flynt Pipeline
        </div>
        <h3 class="ns-card-title">Your pipeline compounds. Every lead tracked, every relationship preserved.</h3>
        <hr class="ns-divider" />
        <ul class="ns-list ns-list--new">
          <li>
            <span class="ns-item-icon ns-item-icon--check"><svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span>
            Every Flynt lead lands in your pipeline automatically. No manual entry. Ever.
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="ns-item-icon ns-item-icon--check"><svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span>
            Search by name, company, industry, stage, or score. Find anyone in seconds.
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="ns-item-icon ns-item-icon--check"><svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span>
            Every lead arrives pre-loaded with contact details, match score, signals, and hooks already there.
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="ns-item-icon ns-item-icon--check"><svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span>
            Every lead carries its full intelligence package: who they are, why they matched, what to say.
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="ns-item-icon ns-item-icon--check"><svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span>
            Land a placement. Come back, every lead exactly where you left it, nothing lost.
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="ns-item-icon ns-item-icon--check"><svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span>
            "Not now" leads sit in their own stage. Surface them when the timing changes.
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="ns-item-icon ns-item-icon--check"><svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span>
            Your pipeline compounds. Every lead tracked, every relationship preserved.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="new-shift__close">
      <div class="new-shift__close-divider">
        <span class="new-shift__close-line"></span>
        <div class="new-shift__close-icon">
          <img src="/images/logo-mark.svg" alt="" width="24" height="24" />
        </div>
        <span class="new-shift__close-line new-shift__close-line--right"></span>
      </div>
      <p>Spreadsheets don't lose leads. People lose leads when a spreadsheet is the only system they have.</p>
      <strong class="new-shift__close-headline">Flynt Pipeline is the system.</strong>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<!-- ─────────────────────────────────────────────
  SECTION 3 — SEARCH
───────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="section" style="background: var(--white);">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header section-header--center">
      <div class="tag" style="margin: 0 auto 16px;">
        <svg width="13" height="13" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><path d="m21 21-4.35-4.35"/></svg>
        Instant Search
      </div>
      <h2>Find any lead in seconds. <span class="hl">Not minutes.</span></h2>
      <p>Name. Company. Industry. Stage. Score. Search any way you think of a lead and find them immediately — the lead you're thinking of is one query away. No scrolling. No rebuilding lists from scratch. Your entire history of Flynt-delivered leads, organized and searchable without any manual upkeep.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="fp-search-demo">
      <input
        class="fp-search-bar"
        type="text"
        placeholder="Search by name, company, industry, stage, or score…"
        readonly
        aria-label="Search demo (display only)"
      />
      <div class="fp-search-results">
        <div class="fp-search-result">
          <div>
            <div class="fp-search-result__name">Sarah Chen</div>
            <div class="fp-search-result__meta">TechCorp · Stage: Contacted</div>
          </div>
          <div class="fp-search-result__score">94% match</div>
        </div>
        <div class="fp-search-result">
          <div>
            <div class="fp-search-result__name">Marcus Reid</div>
            <div class="fp-search-result__meta">GrowthCo · Stage: Proposal</div>
          </div>
          <div class="fp-search-result__score">87% match</div>
        </div>
        <div class="fp-search-result">
          <div>
            <div class="fp-search-result__name">Priya Nair</div>
            <div class="fp-search-result__meta">ScaleUp Inc · Stage: New</div>
          </div>
          <div class="fp-search-result__score">91% match</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

